I am on the escalator.
I come upstairs.
The metro gates are ahead.
I take out my new card.
I tap the card on the machine.
The gate opens.
I go to the platform.
I need to go near the sea.
I am standing behind the yellow line.
There are many people on the platform.
After a short while, a new metro arrives.
The train stops at the platform.
The train doors open.
First, some people alight from the train.
Then I board the metro.
The AC is on in the carriage.
It is very cool inside.
The train doors close.
The metro moves forward.
